          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua malu â yeye wakalua nʼanyi ku tshibuelelu tshiakadi tshitangila ku luseke lua esete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekumona! Butumbi bua Nzambi wa Isalele buakadi bufuma ku luseke lua esete. Tshiona tshia dî diandi tshiakadi bu tshiona tshia mai a bungi; ne buloba buakadi bukenka ne butumbi buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshinfuanyi tshinakamona tshiakadi bu tshinfuanyi tshinakamona hakalueye bua kushiha musoko, ne bu tshinfuanyi tshinakamona ku muelelu wa musula wa Kebâ; nakatua mpala wanyi hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butumbi bua Yehowa buakabuela munda mua ntempelo mu nshila wa ku tshibuelelu tshidi tshitangua ku luseke lua esete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma wakangambula, wakalua nʼanyi mu tshiendelu tshia munda, ekumona! Butumbi bua Yehowa buakusha ntempelo tente.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunvua mukuabo ungambila dî diakafuma mu nsubu wa tshitendelelu, muntu wakadi muimane hehi nʼanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, eu mmuaba wa nkuasa wanyi wa butumbi, eu mmuaba wa makasa anyi kudiatau, muaba undualua kushikama munkatshi mua Bena Isalele tshiendelele. Bena Isalele kabanyangi dina dianyi dia tshijila kabidi, nansha bobo bine, nansha bakelenge babo, ku masandi abo ne mpingu, ne ku bitalu bia banfumu babo hafuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakadinyanga hakatekabo mushiku wabo wa mbelu hehi ne mushiku wanyi wa mbelu, ne dikunshi diabo hehi ne dikunshi dianyi, ne bakadi anu ne lumbu hankatshi hanyi nʼabo. Bakunyanga dina dianyi dia tshijila ku malu a bundu akuenzabo. Bua malu â onso nakubashihesha mu tshiji tshianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpindiu bumushe masandi abo a kutendelela kuabo kua mpingu ku mpala kuanyi ne bitalu bia banfumu babo, bateke malu â kule, ne meme nenshikame munkatshi muabo tshiendelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe kabidi, muana wa muntu, lesha Bena Isalele ntempelo eu, tshifundu tshiandi ne tshidikishilu tshiandi, bua bundu bubakuate bua malu onso akenzabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikalabo ne bundu bua malu onso akenzabo, ubamanyishe bua tshifundu tshia kuasa nʼatshi nsubu wa ntempelo, miaba ya kuhatukila ne ya kubuelela, bilele bia kulondamu, kulongolola kua kutendelela ne mikenji yandi; funda malu au onso ku mesu kuabo bua bobo balonde dilongolola dia malu andi onso, batumikile mikenji yandi yonso ne benze malu au onso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eu mmukenji bua ntempelo: nseke yonso idi inyunguluka muaba eu wa ha mutu ha mukuna ikale miaba mitambe tshijila. Mona biebe ne, Eu ndi mukenji bua ntempelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eku nkuidikisha kua tshioshelu tshia milambu ku luidi lua coudées, luidi lua coudées ludi coudée umue ne ntanta wa tshianza. Tshitekelu tshiatshi tshikale coudée umue mu bule buatshi, coudée umue mu butshiama buatshi, ne tshikale ne muhimbu bunene bua ntanta wa tshianza ku mibangu yatshi; tshitaku tshiatshi tshia muinshi mua tshioshelu tshikale nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mutu kua tshitekelu tshia muinshi tô ne ku tshia tshioshelu tshia ha mutu hatshi kuikale coudées ibidi, ne butshiama bua tshituha etshi buikale coudée umue. Ku mutu kua tshituha etshi tshidi tshihite bukese tô ne ku tshituha tshia ha mutu hatshi tshidi tshihite bunene kuikale coudées inai, butshiama buatshi buikale coudée umue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matshua a tshioshelu a ha mutu hatshi ikale coudées inai mu bule bua mulu; nsengu inai ikale ha mutu ha matshua, lusengu ne lusengu luikale ne bule bua coudée umue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matshua a tshioshelu ikale ne bule bua coudées dikumi ne ibidi ne butshiama bua coudées dikumi ne ibidi, nseke yau inai ikale bunene bumue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshituha tshia tshioshelu tshia muinshi mua matshua tshikale bunene bumue ne nseke yatshi inai, coudées dikumi ne mai mu bule buatshi ne coudées dikumi ne inai mu butshiama buatshi; tshikale ne muhimbu bunene bua tshituha tshia coudée munyunguluke nseke yatshi inai. Tshibandilu tshia ku tshioshelu tshikale ku luseke lua esete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Ei idi mikenji bua tshioshelu mu dituku didibo batshijadika, bua kufidilahu milambu ya kuosha ne bua kumiaminabu mashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Uheshe bakuidi ba Bena Lewi, tunkanunuma tua Sadoka, badi ha buihi nʼanyi bua kunkuatshila mudimu, mulumʼa ngombe bu mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angata mashi andi makuabo, laba ku nsengu inai ya tshioshelu, ne ku matumba anai a tshituha tshia tshioshelu tshidi muinshi mua matshua, ne ku mihimbu idi mitshinyunguluke; nunku lengesha tshioshelu ne utshiumushile bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe angata mulumʼa ngombe wa mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi, umuoshe mu muaba musungula wa mu luhangu lua ntempelo udi kauyi mu tshitendelelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halua dituku dibidi, fila mpumbu wa mbushi udi kayi ne tshilema bu mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau mibi; nunku tshioshelu ne tshilengeshibue bu muakalengeshibuatshi ku mulambu wa mulumʼa ngombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawamana kutshilengesha, fila mulumʼa ngombe udi kayi ne tshilema, ne tshimpanga tshia mu tshisumbu tshia mikoko tshidi katshiyi ne tshilema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawalua ne munyinyi wabi ku mpala kua Yehowa, bakuidi belehu luehu ne bobo babifile bu mulambu wa kuoshela Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tô ne hahita matuku muanda mutekete longolola mpumbu wa mbushi buatshia-buatshia bu mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi; bobo balongolole kahidi mulumʼa ngombe udi kayi ne tshilema ne tshimpanga tshia mu tshisumbu tshia mikoko tshidi katshiyi ne tshilema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tô ne hahita matuku muanda mutekete balengeshe tshioshelu ne hatshiumushile bubi buatshi, nunku, batshijidile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
